-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ד/9 (23.5.2024), תשלום שכר ראוי בגין שביתה חלקית —
-- עובדי הוראה בחטיבות העליונות
-- A teaching employee who takes part in a partial strike (sanctions) is
-- paid only "proper pay" for the work actually done, by the Treasury wage
-- commissioner's instructions of 9.4.2024 — and the circular itself is
-- frozen, by the National Labour Court's decision of 23.5.2024, until
-- further instructions.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ד/9 — תשלום שכר ראוי בגין שביתה חלקית`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 The letterhead, date, reference number, addressees (the owners of upper-secondary schools), greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- The freeze: by the National Labour Court's decision of 23.5.2024 the
-- circular is frozen "at this stage", until further instructions. Whether
-- such instructions have since been given is an input; the circular as
-- published is frozen.
@ref akn:hc_1/p13
GIVEN `further instructions given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc further instructions lifting the freeze have been given after the National Labour Court's decision of 23.5.2024
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular is frozen` `further instructions given` IF
    NOT `further instructions given`

-- The union announced sanctions from 10.3.2024.
@ref akn:hc_1/p15
`the sanctions began on` MEANS Date 10 3 2024

@desc A teaching employee's month, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `month under sanctions` HAS
    `took part in the partial strike`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc took part in the partial strike (sanctions, עיצומים) the union announced
    `full monthly pay`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc the pay for the month had the employee done all the work
    `the proper pay`                   IS A NUMBER  @desc the pay for the work actually done, as the wage commissioner's instructions of 9.4.2024 compute it (an input: the circular does not restate them)

-- Government decisions 647 (22.4.80) and 646 (26.5.81) and the wage
-- commissioner's circular of 9.4.2024: an employee in a partial strike is
-- paid only partial pay ("proper pay") for the work actually done.
@ref akn:hc_1/p14
GIVEN m IS A `month under sanctions`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay for the month` m IS
    IF m's `took part in the partial strike`
    THEN min (m's `the proper pay`) (m's `full monthly pay`)
    ELSE m's `full monthly pay`

DECLARE `sanctions action` IS ONE OF
    `pay by the wage commissioner's instructions` HAS `paid` IS A NUMBER

-- The owners must act by the wage commissioner's instructions of 9.4.2024
-- (linked as tashlomc.pdf) — while the circular is not frozen. Time in
-- salary months from the month of the sanctions (0).
@ref akn:hc_1/p16 akn:hc_1/p17
GIVEN m IS A `month under sanctions`, `further instructions given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `sanctions action`
DECIDE `the owner pays proper pay` m `further instructions given` IS
    IF `the circular is frozen` `further instructions given`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay by the wage commissioner's instructions` p PROVIDED p EQUALS `the pay for the month` m
         WITHIN 1
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "the owners must act by the wage commissioner's instructions of 9.4.2024 on proper pay"

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: the signatures and the copies list; no rule.

-- Examples. The pay figures are placeholders: the circular leaves the
-- computation of proper pay to the wage commissioner's instructions.
`a month in the sanctions` MEANS
    `month under sanctions` WITH
        `took part in the partial strike` IS TRUE
        `full monthly pay`                IS 10000
        `the proper pay`                  IS 9000

#ASSERT `the pay for the month` `a month in the sanctions` EQUALS 9000
#ASSERT `the circular is frozen` FALSE
#ASSERT `the sanctions began on` EQUALS Date 10 3 2024

#TRACE `the owner pays proper pay` `a month in the sanctions` FALSE AT 0 WITH
#TRACE `the owner pays proper pay` `a month in the sanctions` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay by the wage commissioner's instructions` 9000 AT 1
